#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:1
#: 7b4beff83d1f4b248428b6beaeaeec29
msgid "卡片文档编写规范"
msgstr "Writing Card Documentation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:3
#: c1a544a7c2994580a0cfa2897f15dd7d
msgid "目标：让用户从\"模型哪里不行 → 训练集缺什么数据 → 选哪张卡 → 设什么参数 → 怎么判断改善\"一路走通，而不是只解释每个参数的抽象含义。"
msgstr ""
"Goal: guide users from “where the model fails → what data the training set lacks → "
"which card to choose → which parameters to set → how to verify improvement,” rather "
"than merely defining parameters in isolation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:5
#: b24cab451af445b5b0993d54b5e67a4c
msgid "语言风格"
msgstr "Writing style"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:7
#: 27f78baa31a44cb29d0d6309cd84e600
msgid "核心原则：像人在给你讲，不像在查 schema"
msgstr "Core principle: explain like a knowledgeable colleague, not a schema browser"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:9
#: 85d95b75acda418594c237f762bc4793
msgid "参数说明是写给用户的，不是写给数据库的。如果 33 张卡、每张卡 5-20 个参数，全用同一个句式写，用户读 3 张就疲劳了。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter descriptions are for users, not databases. Repeating one sentence pattern "
"across dozens of cards and hundreds of parameters makes the manual exhausting to "
"read."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:11
#: 6ae9f551b03349f98065d57bd15e1853
msgid "禁止的写法"
msgstr "Avoid"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:13
#: 50f89992d6c44b5c844e388fbe752a8d
msgid "每段以独立一行的 \"类型：X。默认：Y。\" 开头，然后再换行另起一段\"解释\"。类型和默认值是背景信息，不是段落主角。"
msgstr ""
"Opening every block with a standalone “Type: X. Default: Y.” line and moving the "
"actual explanation to another paragraph. Type and default are context, not the main "
"point."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:14
#: 1b47c6624f824718b7c603ece1ee9617
msgid "所有参数用同一个句式：\"设置 XXX。\"\"决定是否 XXX。\"\"选择 XXX。\""
msgstr ""
"Using the same template for every parameter: “Sets X,” “Determines whether X,” or "
"“Selects X.”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:15
#: 7128f242e7cd443a87ac038d1aeaef91
msgid "第一行和第二行语义重复——先说\"设置位移距离\"，再换行说\"每个原子的位移\"。"
msgstr ""
"Repeating the same idea in consecutive sentences, such as “sets the displacement "
"distance” followed by “the displacement of each atom.”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:16
#: 2b7e0470a91d4fc8afbf5c36f9833082
msgid "通篇没有\"你\"——读者感觉是在看机器生成的规格书，不是有人在跟自己说话。"
msgstr ""
"Never addressing the reader, which makes the page feel like a generated specification"
" instead of practical guidance."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:17
#: 8b941d56424e41f697bdd8073cda1981
msgid "用一串无关的“不做什么”定义功能，例如在原子扰动页罗列“不做弛豫、不做能量筛选”。如果用户从卡片名称和参数中本来就不会期待某项能力，不要专门否定它；直接说明真实效果或需要处理的具体风险。"
msgstr "Do not define a feature through a list of unrelated things it does not do—for example, stating on the Atomic Perturb page that it does not relax structures or filter by energy. If users would not reasonably expect a capability from the card name or parameters, do not deny it explicitly. State the actual effect or the specific risk that must be handled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:19
#: 125f9882c719492cad0717c50af35bd4
msgid "推荐写法"
msgstr "Preferred approach"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:21
#: cb086969c3ca4566977c2a47b3d67267
msgid "类型和默认值压缩成一句话，然后直接进入读者真正关心的内容。句式要有变化，要敢用\"你\"。"
msgstr ""
"Compress type and default into one sentence, then move directly to what the reader "
"needs to decide. Vary sentence structure and address the reader naturally when giving"
" advice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:23
#: 7a88e40cbdb543d9bcff4f09bb348fe9
msgid "**改前（机器感）：**"
msgstr "**Before (schema-like):**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:25
#: c8b67677b3ef414584587c6046fa4541
msgid ""
"### Max Distance（max_distance）\n"
"类型：`float`。默认：`0.3`。设置原子随机位移的最大距离。\n"
"\n"
"每个原子的最大位移向量长度。这是绝对长度（单位 Å），不是每个 Cartesian 分量的上限，也不是百分比。室温下典型固体原子振动幅度约 0.05~0.1 Å，设 "
"0.15~0.3 Å 通常合适。含 H 等轻元素时考虑开启 `use_element_scaling` 单独调大 H 的幅度。\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Max Distance (`max_distance`)\n"
"Type: `float`. Default: `0.3`. Sets the maximum random atomic displacement.\n"
"\n"
"The maximum length of each atom's displacement vector. This is an absolute length in "
"Å, not a per-component bound or a percentage. Typical room-temperature vibrational "
"amplitudes are around 0.05–0.1 Å, so 0.15–0.3 Å is often suitable. For light elements"
" such as H, consider `use_element_scaling`.\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:32
#: 323adb0d3297477aa2c074016fb90b37
msgid "**改后：**"
msgstr "**After:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:34
#: 822b8a9a2b6d4504b791157afe914290
msgid ""
"### Max Distance（max_distance）\n"
"\n"
"`float`，默认 0.3。每个原子的最大位移，单位 Å。\n"
"\n"
"这个值不是 Cartesian 分量上限，也不是应变百分比——就是一个原子最多被挪多远。室温下原子振动幅度约 0.05~0.1 Å，设 0.15~0.3 Å "
"通常够用。如果体系含 H 等轻元素，H 的振幅天然更大，建议同时开启 `use_element_scaling` 单独给 H 调大。设到 0.3~0.5 Å "
"以上时，跑完务必抽查最近邻键长——这个量级已经可能拉断键了。\n"
"\n"
"生效条件：开启 `use_element_scaling` 后，对在 `element_scalings` 中列出的元素，这个值会被覆盖。\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Max Distance (`max_distance`)\n"
"\n"
"`float`, default: `0.3`. Maximum displacement of each atom, in Å.\n"
"\n"
"This is neither a Cartesian-component bound nor a strain percentage; it is the "
"farthest an atom may move. Room-temperature vibrational amplitudes are often around "
"0.05–0.1 Å, so 0.15–0.3 Å is usually sufficient. If the system contains light "
"elements such as H, enable `use_element_scaling` and give H a larger limit. At "
"0.3–0.5 Å or above, inspect nearest-neighbor distances after generation because bonds"
" may be severely distorted.\n"
"\n"
"Effective when: with `use_element_scaling` enabled, values listed in "
"`element_scalings` override this global limit.\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:44
#: 5b982cfa1f8947918c702c40b0f55323
msgid "变化点："
msgstr "What changed:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:45
#: 4dfa990de9b348748a29e13b2beedc68
msgid "第一行不再是独立的 \"类型：X。默认：Y。\"，而是压缩成 `类型，默认值。描述。`"
msgstr ""
"The opening is one compact sentence—type, default, and purpose—instead of a "
"standalone metadata line."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:46
#: 5fdc2aee45a64d4898e8f795d1608042
msgid "\"你\"出现了——用户在读一个人写的东西"
msgstr "The reader is addressed naturally, making the explanation sound written for a person."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:47
#: 77492e2a192f4a2ab13ded9c28437300
msgid "\"如果...建议...\" 替代了 \"考虑开启\""
msgstr "A concrete condition and recommendation replace the vague phrase “consider enabling.”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:48
#: 9a8e974200664d1095b3f18e0b2f2d35
msgid "\"务必\" 替代 \"需要\"——人的语气"
msgstr "The warning uses direct, human wording instead of generic obligation language."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:49
#: 4bb5410a097e462f9bf17186c51514ce
msgid "没有重复解释——不说一遍\"设置位移\"，又说一遍\"位移长度\""
msgstr "The same meaning is not restated in adjacent sentences."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:50
#: e2069aea0bbf456c9010d226f68d7641
msgid "生效条件放在末尾，不和主描述抢节奏"
msgstr ""
"The activation condition is placed at the end so it does not interrupt the main "
"explanation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:52
#: 95e138ccd6ad421f8870cc96426d79ad
msgid "句式要有变化"
msgstr "Vary sentence structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md f6061bd672e24e23ba5fd89d1f3c2f00
msgid "不要总用"
msgstr "Do not always write"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md 5fb1483dab1443e59e96809b78dc1ad8
msgid "偶尔换成"
msgstr "Alternative phrasing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md 3859e1a751104d9e8cc4392a7cde1206
msgid "设置 XXX。"
msgstr "Sets X."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md 9a2f4c31fafb446eb28ef818084c15ca
msgid "XXX 控制... / 这个值决定... / 改了它会影响..."
msgstr "X controls… / This value determines… / Changing it affects…"

