msgstr "Determines whether X."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md b79f625a36084cd19ef3db770e9a4109
msgid "打开之后... / 关了的话..."
msgstr "When enabled… / When disabled…"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md 2a0a3ffcc6304d28801f245d453d4c8f
