msgstr "Selects X."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md 526fa71c1dc14205ab4aad35b9e68a69
msgid "有两种模式：... / 可选值：... / 通常用..."
msgstr "Two modes are available… / Choices are… / In most cases, use…"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md 3f0c0364fb7d45299a0285e6bf5eb68e
msgid "建议..."
msgstr "Recommended…"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md 35faccd68d2a4b51bc78a44d1b055106
msgid "你很可能只需要... / 大多数情况... / 除非...否则不用动"
msgstr "You will usually need only… / In most cases… / Leave this unchanged unless…"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:61
#: 9d028fb7d62a4f39ad74f5a306045c47
msgid "什么时候用\"你\""
msgstr "When to address the reader"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:63
#: a59f50f3e1db4622833e472aed1fe2bd
msgid "以下情况应该用\"你\"："
msgstr "Address the reader when:"

