msgstr "Giving advice: “You will probably need only the default.”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:65
#: 393fa9bf9b484d4cb22a36e10cd0543a
msgid "警告时：\"设太大可能会拉断键，你最好先抽查几个输出\""
msgstr ""
"Warning about consequences: “A large value may break bonds; inspect several outputs "
