msgstr "Worked-example template (highest priority)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:91
#: 42bbe5ff39e541a6bebb79df0082e305
msgid "操作示例必须从**训练集诊断**出发，不能只写\"设参数→得结果\"。结构："
msgstr ""
"A worked example must begin with a **training-set diagnosis**, not merely “set "
"parameters → get output.” Use this structure:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:93
#: 1c29c96fe5064e0fa2475f9bd1c72a98
msgid ""
"### 场景：模型在 [具体任务] 上 [具体失败表现]\n"
"\n"
"[一句话诊断根因：训练集缺什么数据]\n"
"\n"
"**输入：** [具体结构]\n"
"**目标：** [加入什么数据，预期解决什么问题]\n"
"**参数设置：** [具体参数值]\n"
"**输出：** [预期输出描述]\n"
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** [重训后应看到什么变化；不够的话下一步怎么调]\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Scenario: the model [specific failure] on [specific task]\n"
"\n"
"[Diagnose in one sentence what data the training set lacks.]\n"
"\n"
"**Input:** [concrete structure]\n"
"**Goal:** [data to add and problem it should address]\n"
"**Parameters:** [specific values]\n"
"**Output:** [expected structures]\n"
"**How to verify improvement:** [change expected after labeling and retraining; next "
"adjustment if insufficient]\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:105
#: 711d31550f774df3a08df4954d155476
msgid "示例（Lattice Strain）："
msgstr "Example: Lattice Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:107
#: 0a06a66d484245cebca51dd88485a67d
msgid ""
"### 场景：模型预测的弹性常数偏差太大\n"
"\n"
"NEP 模型 C11 比 DFT 参考值高 15%。训练集所有结构都处在平衡体积附近，模型没见过被拉伸/压缩的晶胞，只能外推。\n"
"\n"
"**输入：** 弛豫好的 Si 单胞\n"
"**目标：** 加入 ±2% 单轴应变结构，让模型在弹性区内有内插依据\n"
"**参数设置：** Axes=uniaxial, x_range=[-2, 2, 1]\n"
"**输出：** 5 个结构（-2%, -1%, 0%, +1%, +2%）\n"
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后 C11 应接近 DFT 参考值；不够则扩到 ±5%\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Scenario: the predicted elastic constant is too inaccurate\n"
"\n"
"The NEP value of C11 is 15% above the DFT reference. Every training structure lies "
"near the equilibrium volume, so strained cells are extrapolations.\n"
"\n"
"**Input:** A relaxed Si unit cell\n"
"**Goal:** Add ±2% uniaxial strain states so the elastic region is interpolative\n"
"**Parameters:** `Axes=uniaxial`, `x_range=[-2, 2, 1]`\n"
"**Output:** Five structures at −2%, −1%, 0%, +1%, and +2%\n"
"**How to verify improvement:** After DFT labeling and retraining, C11 should approach"
" the reference; if needed, extend the range to ±5%\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:119
#: 2e21743fac7a42fcab465bc720f06323
msgid "示例（Magnetic Order）："
msgstr "Example: Magnetic Order"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:121
#: 7c7c16a501d14bb891799e246b3169cd
msgid ""
"### 场景：FM 模型在 AFM 相上预测崩了\n"
"\n"
"bcc Fe 的 NEP 模型，FM 构型推理准确但 AFM 构型能量误差是 FM 的 5 倍。训练集只有一种磁序。\n"
"\n"
"**输入：** bcc Fe 晶体，已知 Fe 磁矩约 2.2 μB\n"
"**目标：** 生成 1 FM + 1 AFM + 8 PM，让模型见过不同磁序的局域磁环境\n"
"**参数设置：** magmom_map=Fe:2.2, gen_fm+gen_afm+gen_pm, pm_count=8\n"
"**输出：** 10 个不同磁序结构\n"
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后 FM/AFM 推理能量误差差距应显著缩小\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Scenario: an FM model fails on the AFM phase\n"
"\n"
"A bcc Fe NEP predicts FM configurations accurately, but the AFM energy error is five "
"times larger. The training set contains only one magnetic order.\n"
"\n"
"**Input:** bcc Fe with a known Fe moment of about 2.2 μB\n"
"**Goal:** generate 1 FM + 1 AFM + 8 PM structures so the model sees local "
"environments from different magnetic orders\n"
"**Parameters:** magmom_map=Fe:2.2, gen_fm+gen_afm+gen_pm, pm_count=8\n"
"**Output:** 10 structures with different magnetic orders\n"
"**How to verify improvement:** after retraining, the FM/AFM inference energy-error "
"gap should shrink substantially\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:133
#: cc700b100fb648d2ab19b747d3ce71b1
msgid "示例（Random Doping）："
msgstr "Example: Random Doping"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:135
#: 70cbbb6754f341ccbf99b44f015a8345
msgid ""
"### 场景：纯元素模型在掺杂体系上完全失效\n"
"\n"
"纯 Si 训练的 NEP 模型碰到 Si:Ge 合金，力误差跳了一个数量级。模型从来没见过 Ge 原子。\n"
"\n"
"**输入：** 纯 Si 超胞\n"
"**目标：** 替换 3-8% 的 Si 为 Ge，每帧生成 20 个掺杂版本\n"
"**参数设置：** rules(target=Si,dopants=Ge:1.0,use=atomic_percent,percent=[3,8]), "
"doping_type=Exact, max_structures=20\n"
"**输出：** 20 个掺杂结构\n"
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后 Si:Ge 测试集力 MAE 应回到纯 Si 水平\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Scenario: an elemental model fails on a doped system\n"
"\n"
"An NEP model trained on pure Si shows an order-of-magnitude force-error increase on "
"Si–Ge because it has never seen Ge environments.\n"
"\n"
"**Input:** A pure-Si supercell\n"
"**Goal:** Replace 3–8% of Si with Ge and generate 20 doped variants per frame\n"
"**Parameters:** `rules(target=Si,dopants=Ge:1.0,use=atomic_percent,percent=[3,8])`, "
"`doping_type=Exact`, `max_structures=20`\n"
"**Output:** Twenty doped structures\n"
"**How to verify improvement:** After labeling and retraining, force MAE on a held-out"
" Si–Ge test set should approach the pure-Si error\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:147
#: 343ad87df68145d8beb568b281a2f255
msgid "参数说明写法"
msgstr "Writing parameter sections"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:149
#: 5a88105fe4cc4549bf88c3d548999638
msgid "只允许一种参数写法：每个 `Params dataclass` 字段必须有独立标题，标题里的 key 必须和代码字段完全一致。"
msgstr ""
"Use one consistent structure: every field in the `Params` dataclass has its own "
"heading, and the key in that heading must exactly match the code."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:151
#: c6fd708e14c9424880d5cbc381c4034f
msgid "参数少、没有明显功能组时，直接使用三级标题："
msgstr "For a short parameter list with no natural groups, use level-three headings:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:153
#: c64bb7805c4e4ad1868b7cbb7b858856
msgid ""
"### Axes（axes）\n"
"\n"
"类型：`str`。默认：`\"uniaxial\"`。决定对哪些晶格轴施加应变。\n"
"\n"
"物理直觉：单轴用于补 C11/C22/C33；双轴用于泊松耦合；各向同性用于 EOS 或体模量附近采样。\n"
"\n"
"| 选项 | 含义 | 什么时候选 |\n"
"|------|------|-----------|\n"
"| `uniaxial` | 一次只拉压一个轴 | 弹性常数、各向异性响应 |\n"
"| `biaxial` | 两两组合 | 面内耦合、薄膜应变 |\n"
"| `isotropic` | 三轴等比例 | 体积-能量曲线 |\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Axes (`axes`)\n"
"\n"
"`str`, default: `\"uniaxial\"`. Selects which lattice axes are strained together.\n"
"\n"
"Physical interpretation: use uniaxial strain for C11/C22/C33-like responses, biaxial "
"strain for coupled in-plane or Poisson response, and isotropic strain for an equation"
" of state or bulk modulus.\n"
"\n"
"| Option | Meaning | When to use |\n"
"|--------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| `uniaxial` | Strain one axis at a time | Elastic constants and anisotropic response"
" |\n"
"| `biaxial` | Strain axis pairs | In-plane coupling and film strain |\n"
"| `isotropic` | Scale all three axes equally | Energy–volume curves |\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:167
#: c7b91feb600a4b6aa4d69066aa46fd02
msgid "参数多且存在天然功能组时，用三级标题表示功能组，用四级标题表示参数："
msgstr ""
"For many parameters with natural functional groups, use level-three headings for "
"groups and level-four headings for fields:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:169
#: 06c041b4b0fb46f18542ad32228f848d
msgid ""
"### 磁矩幅值来源\n"
"\n"
"#### Magmom Map（magmom_map）\n"
"\n"
"类型：`str`。默认：`\"\"`。按元素指定磁矩幅值，例如 `Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6`。\n"
"\n"
"物理直觉：已知元素局域磁矩时优先用它，避免不同磁性卡各自写一套不一致的幅值。\n"
msgstr ""
"\\### Moment-magnitude source\n"
"\n"
"\\#### Magmom Map (`magmom_map`)\n"
"\n"
"`str`, default: `\"\"`. Assign element-specific magnitudes, for example `Fe:2.2, "
"Ni:0.6`.\n"
"\n"
"Physical interpretation: when trusted local moments are known, define them once here "
"so downstream magnetic cards do not drift into inconsistent magnitudes.\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:179
#: 9223cf93fcdb4d5396f3ff83858b0aca
msgid "每个参数 block 固定包含："
msgstr "Every parameter block contains:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:181
#: 2220e53d3b7147c0a1f00fc9cf09de19
msgid "第一段：类型、默认值、这个参数实际控制什么。"
msgstr "First paragraph: type, default, and the quantity or behavior actually controlled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:182
#: 82075b45c94e4f3ca00445914c0b749a
msgid "第二段：物理直觉或数据集使用场景，必须给量级或判断依据。"
msgstr ""
"Second paragraph: physical intuition or a dataset scenario, including a useful scale "
"or decision criterion."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:183
#: 00c4fb78f522496e9b623af1d45080c4
msgid "枚举参数：加表格，列出选项、含义、什么时候选。"
msgstr "Enums: a table listing each real option, its meaning, and when to choose it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:184
#: 7d35cc796fac499eba0fbb430f55d293
msgid "条件参数：单独写 `生效条件：...`，不要让用户猜这个参数什么时候会被忽略。"
msgstr ""
"Conditional fields: an explicit `Effective when: ...` line so users know when the "
"field is ignored."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:186
#: ccb922ea9d924f00b79f5d2adfead000
msgid ""
"禁止把多个 key 合在一个标题里，例如 `Use Seed / Seed（use_seed / seed）`。必须拆成 `### Use Seed（use_seed）`"
" 和 `### Seed（seed）`。 禁止用占位表格，例如 `以 UI 下拉项为准`。枚举表必须写出真实选项，如 Sobol/Uniform、Collinear"
"/Non-collinear、sphere/cone。 禁止用可套在任何参数上的模板句。`物理直觉` "
"必须能回答这个参数调大、调小、切换选项时具体改变了什么物理状态或数据分布。"
msgstr ""
"Do not combine several keys under one heading such as `Use Seed / Seed (use_seed / "
"seed)`; split them into `### Use Seed (use_seed)` and `### Seed (seed)`. Do not use "
"placeholder enum tables such as “see the UI dropdown.” List real "
"options—Sobol/Uniform, Collinear/Non-collinear, sphere/cone. Avoid generic text that "
"fits any field. The physical explanation must state how increasing, decreasing, or "
"switching the parameter changes the physical state or data distribution."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:190
#: adca7134708d4f108502d81bd70441aa
msgid "**禁止在参数说明中出现的内容：**"
msgstr "**Do not include the following in user-facing parameter sections:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:191
#: 95294550f3d040cd96591206af57cf4c
msgid "`UI Label`、`字段映射`、`控件标签`、`控件解释` 等 UI 实现细节"
msgstr ""
"UI implementation details such as `UI Label`, field mappings, widget labels, or "
"widget explanations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:192
#: 422d69af45da458386d6af482a6ea52b
msgid "序列化格式说明（如\"这是序列化结构字段，不是用户开关\"）"
msgstr ""
"Serialization-internal explanations such as “this is a serialized structure field, "
"not a user option”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:193
#: 0cee774856c442c0a34db78071a3cc39
msgid "`params` 作为独立参数块列出——这是内部实现，用户不需要知道"
msgstr "A separate `params` parameter block; it is an implementation detail"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:194
#: da7cd7737dd44d1a9b3dde916560a27e
msgid "\"先用默认值跑小样本；只有当你能明确说明它会改变当前结果分布时再主动偏离\" 等模板填充句"
msgstr ""
"Filler advice such as “start with the default and change it only when you know it "
"affects the distribution”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:196
#: 1e32924a72d64542a248cfcfd5ba1e7b
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:198
#: b8da0f025335453c89a89a4b90769346
msgid "至少覆盖以下 3 类真问题（不要泛化模板句）："
msgstr "Cover at least these three concrete problem types without generic filler:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:200
#: 66fc69c040004fb4add98d3623b6a344
msgid "输出为空时**这张卡最常见的原因**"
msgstr "The card-specific reason output is empty"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:201
#: 030628ae6d0a4334ab42e475ccdc4945
msgid "输出不合理时**具体怎么判断和回调**"
msgstr "The concrete diagnostic and parameter adjustment for unreasonable output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:202
#: 95f40da35d2a4c728d907e5527b706c1
msgid "参数冲突或越界时**程序的实际行为**"
msgstr "The program's actual behavior when parameters conflict or exceed bounds"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:204
#: 59841880741d497eb6c8414db6fb4b08
msgid "描述行为只能写代码的真实逻辑，不要臆造不存在的自动修复。"
msgstr "Describe only behavior implemented in code; do not invent automatic recovery."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:206
#: 2650dd8d7195415385640f47770cf451
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:208
#: dd0ed940ed5147b8894292b409751b4c
msgid "必须写具体的卡片名，例如 `Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb`，不要写\"当前卡片 → 目标变换卡\"。"
msgstr ""
"Name concrete cards, for example `Lattice Strain → Atomic Perturb`, instead of "
"placeholders such as “current card → target transformation.”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:209
#: a8467960a9154ee38a35a9379198e122
msgid "至少 2 条不同目的的组合建议。"
msgstr "Provide at least two combinations that serve distinct purposes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:211
#: 8d6010f168854979a680bf093ea2e2ed
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:213
#: f6673496025742779a0a394424a8c217
msgid "每档必须有实质性参数差异，不要三档 JSON 几乎一样。"
msgstr "Presets must differ materially; do not provide three nearly identical JSON blocks."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:214
#: ddcfc8022bf6482fb648a53f79391364
msgid "每个 JSON 附带一行说明，解释\"这个预设解决什么问题，什么情况下选这一档\"。"
msgstr ""
"Add one sentence to every JSON preset explaining the problem it solves and when to "
"choose it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:215
#: f9b83dd96dd04f83a4298f0026dd3b96
msgid "如果卡片参数少、不需要三档，允许只保留 1-2 个预设。"
msgstr ""
"For a simple card, one or two meaningful presets are better than three artificial "
"tiers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:217
#: db14df8888134d268ff8a0339f4f2252
msgid "禁止内容"
msgstr "Prohibited content"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:219
#: 0dff90c676c04635a6cbcfc14b8ac6fb
msgid "\"先保守再放大\" 类空泛建议。"
msgstr "Vague advice such as “start conservative, then scale up.”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:220
#: 2589882560644f6192d4de4d9a88716c
msgid "\"先用默认值跑小样本\" 类模板填充句。"
msgstr "Template filler such as “run a small sample with defaults first.”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:221
#: 4f651ff6326d4ca6a6bf2641f5d09153
msgid "与卡片无关的统一 Physics caution 模板句。"
msgstr "A generic physics-caution paragraph unrelated to the card's actual behavior."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:222
#: 9e1faf490b5e40dab2f5aa1230bdf44b
msgid "无关能力免责声明。只有当卡片名称或参数容易让用户产生合理误解，或者遗漏该边界会直接导致错误结果时，才说明“不会/不支持”；否则改写为实际效果、风险或下一步动作。"
msgstr "Disclaimers about unrelated capabilities. State that a card `does not` or `does not support` something only when its name or parameters could reasonably imply otherwise, or when omitting the boundary would directly cause incorrect results. In other cases, describe the actual effect, risk, or next action instead."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:223
#: 2a9ef29a500f42fcacf81d2df5dab57f
msgid "\"需要启用 XXX 对应行为时开启 / 希望保持默认时关闭\" 类同义反复。"
msgstr ""
"Tautologies such as “enable this when you need the enabled behavior; disable it "
"otherwise.”"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:224
#: ad24829cab994003899dc5cb5a0b8472
msgid "没有输入、没有目标、没有验证条件的\"伪示例\"。"
msgstr "Pseudo-examples with no input, goal, or validation condition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:225
#: 28f9bc927a4f48d8ab006e89fcdbd64f
msgid "`params` 字段作为用户文档列在参数说明中。"
msgstr "Listing the internal `params` field as a user parameter."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:227
#: bcfa5985c0f843b79c90a32b31983500
msgid "维护命令"
msgstr "Maintenance commands"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:229
#: 49cd4c2407314c9fa96290ff99ae482c
msgid "`python tools/docs/audit_card_docs.py` — 检查 key 一致性和默认值"
msgstr "`python tools/docs/audit_card_docs.py` — check field-key consistency and defaults"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/writing-guide.md:230
#: 4d4c82b1040e4cb182cf1e0a23eff1bc
msgid "`python -m sphinx -W -b html docs/source docs/build/html` — 文档构建"
msgstr "`python -m sphinx -W -b html docs/source docs/build/html` — build the documentation"

